WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.059 --> 00:00:04.720
- What are we doing?

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.930
Jacob Blake’s father asked that same
question after learning that his son

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:10.329
was shot seven times in the back.

00:00:11.969 --> 00:00:14.910
After learning that Kenosha
Police tried to murder his son.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:19.189
After learning that his grandkids
watched it all happen in the backseat.

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:20.590
- [Jacob Blake Sr.] Like he didn’t matter.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:21.560
- What are we doing?

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:24.610
♪♪♪ They trainin' officers to kill us, then
shootin' protesters with these rubber bullets. ♪♪♪

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:26.330
♪♪♪ They regular people, I know that they feel it. ♪♪♪

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:27.719
♪♪♪ These scars too deep to heal us. ♪♪♪

00:00:27.719 --> 00:00:28.529
♪♪♪ What happened to COVID? ♪♪♪

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:29.415
♪♪♪ Nobody remember. ♪♪♪

00:00:29.415 --> 00:00:30.372
♪♪♪ It ain't makin' sense. ♪♪♪

00:00:30.372 --> 00:00:31.039
♪♪♪ I'm just here to vent. ♪♪♪

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.443
♪♪♪ It happen to one of your people, it's different. ♪♪♪

00:00:32.443 --> 00:00:34.269
♪♪♪ We get it, the system is wicked. ♪♪♪

00:00:34.269 --> 00:00:35.039
♪♪♪Just learn how to pick it. ♪♪♪

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:36.910
- What are we doing?

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:37.910
Can anyone answer that?

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:39.570
- It’s exhausting being Black.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:40.949
- We are scared as Black people.

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:43.669
- Because this isn’t the first time
a Black person has asked that.

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:44.790
- If not now, when?

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:46.330
- [Master] Maya Moore wants to know.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.959
George Hill wants to know.

00:00:48.219 --> 00:00:49.629
Jaylen Brown wants to know.

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:50.969
What the hell are we doing?

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:54.530
- All you hear is Donald Trump and
all of ‘em talking about fear.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:56.060
We’re the ones getting killed.

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:00.450
- COVID-19 ain’t the only pandemic
that can shut down the NBA.

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:06.449
- [Ernie Johnson] NBA teams refusing to play their
scheduled games in protest of racial injustice

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:09.579
- We’re not responsive to perception
when we’re trying to change reality.

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:15.130
- I think it’s best for me to support the
players and just not be here tonight.

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:17.949
- So what are we doing?

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:19.460
We’re protesting to be heard.

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:22.789
- Don’t listen to these people telling
you, “Don’t do anything because

00:01:22.789 --> 00:01:24.059
it’s not gonna end right away.”

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.040
- Embrace it and be the change
because you are the change.

00:01:28.369 --> 00:01:29.640
♪♪♪ We goin' ultra black. ♪♪♪

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:30.644
♪♪♪ I gotta toast to that. ♪♪♪

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:31.930
- We’re voting for change in November.

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:33.460
We’re fighting against voter suppression

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:34.600
- We need everybody to register to vote.

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:34.929
- Vote.

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:35.230
- Vote.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:36.550
- We’re not being silent.

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:37.910
We’re demanding an answer.

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:39.819
- Wearing a T-shirt is not enough.

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:41.820
- We need to be able to create
those avenues for people.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:42.663
- You gotta be better.

00:01:42.663 --> 00:01:43.759
You gotta do better.

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:44.830
You gotta want better.

00:01:44.929 --> 00:01:50.140
- [Julia Jackson] Let’s use our love and our
intelligence to show the rest of the world

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:54.590
how humans are supposed to treat each other.

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.689
♪♪♪ No matter your race, to me, we all are black. ♪♪♪

00:01:56.990 --> 00:02:00.480
- [Master] And as each game in the
playoffs grows more important, we can’t

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:01.710
ever forget what’s most important.

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:04.449
So what are you doing?

